An ARIMA model(4,0,2), which is just an ARMA(4,2) model had the lowest AIC and 
every parameter is significant.  Let's predict on the train and test sets! Figure
5 displays the LFPR to the predicted LFPR on the training set.  It seems to 
capture the trend of the data.  However, you can see the model has trouble grabbing
the highest and lowest points of the trend.  
```{python}
